{
  "//": [
    "MCP server registration for a LAPTOP, reading through the SSH tunnel.",
    "",
    "The read profile only: mart + ref, parameterized tools, no free-form SQL.",
    "That restriction is ADR 0008's and still holds for anything reachable",
    "remotely -- the ops profile is for an agent on the warehouse host.",
    "",
    "Requires the socket forward from install_hetzner.md ~/.ssh/config:",
    "  ssh -fN fafnir",
    "and a per-person agent role on the server:",
    "  CREATE ROLE rob_mcp LOGIN IN ROLE fafnir_app;",
    "",
    "Still no password: the forward lands on the remote Unix socket, so peer",
    "authentication sees the SSH-authenticated user. The SSH key is the only secret."
  ],
  "mcpServers": {
    "fafnir": {
      "command": "/Users/rob/.venvs/fafnir/bin/fafnir-mcp",
      "args": ["--profile", "read"],
      "env": {
        "FAFNIR_DSN": "host=127.0.0.1 port=15432 dbname=fafnir user=rob_mcp application_name=fafnir-mcp"
      }
    }
  }
}
